+  "5. size 已由用户在渠道设置里锁定为竖图，每张图都填 \"portrait\"；后端规范里关于横竖怎么选的判据本次不适用。按竖画幅取景：多人或宽阔场景靠纵深、前后景层次或更近的景别容纳主体，不要把人横排成一列挤小。": "5. size has been locked as a vertical image in the channel settings by the user, and \"portrait\" is filled in for each image; the criteria for selecting horizontal and vertical in the back-end specifications do not apply this time. Framing in a vertical format: For scenes with many people or a wide area, rely on depth, front and rear background levels, or closer scenes to accommodate the subject. Do not squeeze people into a row horizontally.",
