+  "# 柏宝绘 · SillyTavern 剧情配图助手\r\n\r\n> 让 AI 的每一段精彩剧情都有画面。柏宝绘会一边陪你聊，一边默默判断「这一幕值不值得画」，自动挑选最值得定格的瞬间、写好生图提示词，再交给出图渠道生成图片，直接嵌进楼层里。全程自动，也可随时手动接管。\r\n\r\n光有文字的故事总觉得少了点什么——角色长什么样、战斗场面有多燃、告白那一刻的光线，都只能靠脑补。柏宝绘就是为了把「脑补」变成「亲眼看到」而生的：它不打扰你聊天，只在恰到好处的时候递上一张图。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 它能做什么\r\n\r\n### 🖼️ 自动配图，精彩瞬间不错过\r\n- **自动分析剧情**：每次 AI 回复后，柏宝绘会通读这段剧情，判断有没有值得画的瞬间——有就画，没有就安静跳过，绝不刷屏。\r\n- **自动编写提示词**：英文正向 tag、画面描述、画幅方向、负面词全都自动写好，你几乎不用碰提示词。\r\n- **一次多张**：想多要几张也可以，单次最多可规划多张图，按剧情节奏依次生成。\r\n- **手动接管**：想指定某一楼出图？点楼层上的「生成 tag」按钮即可；写好的 tag 也会直接显示在图片卡片上，随时能看能改。\r\n\r\n### 🎭 角色固定外貌库：外貌永不漂移\r\n- **首次出场自动建档**：有名有姓的正式角色第一次出场，柏宝绘会自动记下他的发色、瞳色、体型等固定外貌，之后每一张图里的他都长一个样。\r\n- **只报名字，不抄外貌**：AI 在提示词里只需写「@角色名」，插件会机械替换成档案里最新、最准确的外貌——彻底杜绝「这一楼金发、下一楼黑发」的漂移问题。\r\n- **永久变化自动更新**：角色染发、剪发、留疤、长大……这些永久变化会被自动记进档案，且**按剧情位置生效**：变化之前的图片用旧外貌，变化之后用新外貌，时间线不错乱。\r\n- **临时状态不混淆**：假发、湿身、包扎这类临时状态不会污染档案，但同一场景里会持续保持，直到剧情解除。\r\n- **手动编辑与回滚**：档案随时可以手动修改、删除；每次 AI 的自动变更都有记录，一键回滚。\r\n- **全局角色库**：玩家角色等「哪个聊天都用同一张脸」的角色，在角色管理页一键「提升为全局」——之后所有聊天自动生效，无需重复建档。全局角色是冻结档案：AI 永远不会修改它，完全由你手动维护；某个聊天想让他不一样，复制回本聊天即可覆盖。\r\n\r\n### 🎨 出图渠道：ComfyUI 与 NovelAI\r\n- **ComfyUI**：两种配置方式任选——**简易参数**模式直接选模型/LoRA、填步数等基础参数即可出图（内置 Checkpoint 系/Flux/Anima 模板，模型列表一键从 ComfyUI 拉取）；**自定义工作流**模式加载你自己的 API 工作流模板，占位符自动填充 tag、描述与尺寸，节点怎么连不用操心——**AI 会自动定位**该填哪个节点、哪些片段要保留，应用前还能预览改动。\r\n- **多套工作流随时切换**：常用的工作流可以各存一套、各起名字，下拉一点就换。自然语言开关与横竖尺寸都跟着工作流走——二次元底模和 Flux 之间来回切，不用再逐项改设置。\r\n- **固定横图 / 竖图**：每个渠道的尺寸旁边都有「画幅方向」：自动 / 竖屏 / 横屏。锁定后每张图都按这个方向出，AI 写提示词时也会按这个画幅去构图，不用再把横竖尺寸填成一样来凑（ComfyUI 每套工作流各设各的）。\r\n- **NovelAI**：官方 v3 / v4 / v5 系列模型；支持 vibe 参考图（角色风、画风参考）；`.naiv4vibe` 文件与官方互通，导入导出都行。\r\n- **NAI 多接入点随时切换**：官方站与各个第三方站可以各存一条、各起名字、各记各的 Key，下拉一点就换。换站只换出口——模型、采样器、尺寸、vibe、画师串这些参数全部照旧，不用重配一遍。官方那条是内置的，地址固定不用填。\r\n- **NAI 自然语言可开可关**：NAI 4.5 的提示词有长度上限（画面与所有角色共用约 512 token），自然语言描述最占篇幅，超出的部分会被截掉、画面跟着走样。觉得 4.5 画得怪，可以在 NAI 渠道里关掉「生成自然语言」，让 AI 只写 tag 试试。\r\n- **渠道灵活**：可以指派专门的副 API 渠道去跑生图，不占用主对话；不配置就跟随主 API。\r\n- **画师串随时切换**：常用的画风/画师组合可以各存一套、各起名字，下拉一点就换，也可以选「不使用」。选中的画师串会拼在提示词最前面，整幅画的画风基调一次定好。\r\n- **负面词、质量词智能默认**：每个模型都有官方推荐的质量词与负面词，点开就能看到实际生效的内容；想改就改，改完会标记「已自定义」，随时一键恢复默认。\r\n\r\n### 📁 图片管理，随聊随存\r\n- **内嵌楼层卡片**：生成好的图片直接嵌在对应楼层下方，与剧情一一对应。\r\n- **显示大小可调**：电脑宽屏上嫌楼层里的图太大？设置页「楼层图片显示大小」有小 / 中 / 大 / 铺满四档。只改聊天里显示多大，不影响出图分辨率，图片文件原样不动。\r\n- **点击放大、长按保存**：灯箱查看大图，长按图片即可保存到本地。\r\n- **出图信息可回溯**：每张图随图记录完整提示词、画师串、vibe（含强度）、模型与采样参数；在灯箱或图库里点开就能看到当时到底怎么画的——喜欢的图再也不会忘记用的哪套配方。\r\n- **重新生成与取消**：对某张图不满意，点一下重绘（同提示词再出一张）；觉得提示词写得不到位，打开铅笔（编辑提示词）弹窗，里面既可以自己改，也可以点「AI 重写提示词」让它重读剧情把这一张的提示词重写一遍再出图——只动这一张，同楼其它图片不受影响。重写期间可以放心关掉弹窗，生成不会中断，回头再打开还能接着看；想整楼重新选画面则用消息 ⋯ 菜单里的调色盘按钮。生成中也可以随时取消，不浪费额度。\r\n- **智能队列**：多张图排队生成，并发数可调，不会把渠道挤爆。\r\n- **可选 JPG 转存**：需要更小的文件体积时，可让 PNG 自动转存为 JPG。\r\n\r\n### 🤝 与柏宝书无缝协作\r\n- 柏宝绘读取柏宝书的角色状态与剧情记忆，让配图与「此刻的剧情」严丝合缝。\r\n- 不想被某段内容打扰？**排除名单与柏宝书共享**——按角色、按世界书整本或按条目名排除，两端同步，一处设置两边生效。\r\n\r\n### ⚙️ 想调多细都行\r\n- **提示词全可编辑**：破限、生图规范、思维链……每一套都有内置默认，也可全部自定义。规范与思维链里还能用 `{{#nl}}…{{/nl}}` / `{{^nl}}…{{/nl}}` 写只在开 / 关「生成自然语言」时生效的段落，一份提示词两种模式都顺。\r\n- **多主题界面**：自动跟随 SillyTavern 配色，手机、平板、电脑都顺手。\r\n- **自动更新**：有新版时导航栏亮起小红点，设置页一键更新并自动刷新。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 安装\r\n\r\n在 SillyTavern 的「扩展 → 安装扩展」里填入本仓库地址即可：\r\n\r\n```\r\nhttps://github.com/baibai-git/ST-BaiBai-Image\r\n```\r\n\r\n安装后进入「设置」页：先到「渠道」页配置出图渠道（本地 ComfyUI 或 NovelAI 账号），再确认「自动生成 tag」开关已打开，就可以开始自动配图了。设置会随 SillyTavern 保存在服务器，跨设备自动同步。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 小贴士\r\n\r\n- **开箱即用**：默认设置下，只要配好出图渠道，AI 每聊一段就会自动配图；不想自动出图、只想先写 tag 的，关掉「自动生成图片」开关即可。\r\n- **角色外貌库是自动维护的**：你不用预先录入任何角色，第一次出场时插件会自动建档；想微调再进「角色管理」页动手。固定用的角色（比如玩家）可以「提升为全局」，换个聊天也不用重新建档。\r\n- **ComfyUI 用户**：不想碰工作流 JSON 的话，用「简易参数」模式选个模型就能出图；有自己的工作流则用 AI 自动配置功能跑通一次，之后一直复用。有多套常用配置的，存成多套随时切换。\r\n- **NovelAI 用户**：vibe 参考图不是必须的，但能让画风/角色更稳定；`.naiv4vibe` 文件与官方互通。\r\n- **图片数据跟着聊天走**：删聊天即删对应图片数据，隐私可控。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 给插件作者\r\n\r\n柏宝绘开放了一套公开接口（`globalThis.STBaiBaiImage`），别的插件可以：\r\n\r\n- **读角色库**：拿到柏宝绘已记录的角色和可直接出图的 tag；\r\n- **调柏宝绘出图**：后端配置、并发闸门、限流退避、图库归档全都复用，**图显示在哪由你决定**——\r\n  画在侧边栏、画在自己的弹窗里都行，生成的图不会进入任何聊天记录。\r\n\r\n详见 **[PUBLIC_API.md](./PUBLIC_API.md)**。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n作者：柏柏 · 欢迎反馈与建议。\r\n": "# BaiBai Image · SillyTavern Story Illustration Assistant\r\n\r\n> Let every exciting plot of AI have pictures. While chatting with you, BaiBai Image will silently judge \"whether this scene is worth painting\", automatically select the most worthy moments, write prompts for drawing, and then send it to the drawing channel to generate pictures and embed them directly on the floor. The whole process is automatic, and can also be taken over manually at any time.\r\n\r\nStories with only words always feel like something is missing - what the characters look like, how exciting the battle scenes are, and the light at the moment of confession can only be filled in by the brain. Baibaohua was born to turn \"imagination\" into \"seeing with your own eyes\": it does not interrupt your chat, but only delivers a picture at the right time.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## What it can do\r\n\r\n### 🖼️ Automatically match pictures, don’t miss the wonderful moments\r\n- **Automatic analysis of the plot**: After each reply from AI, Bai Baohui will read through the plot and determine whether there are any moments worth drawing - if there are any moments, he will draw them; if not, he will skip them quietly and never swipe the screen.\r\n- **Automatically write prompt words**: English positive tag, picture description, frame direction, and negative words are all automatically written, so you almost don’t have to touch the prompt words.\r\n- **Multiple Pictures at One Time**: You can have as many pictures as you want. You can plan up to multiple pictures at a time and generate them sequentially according to the rhythm of the plot.\r\n- **Manual takeover**: Want to specify a certain building to take over? Just click the \"Generate tag\" button on the floor; the written tag will also be displayed directly on the picture card, which can be viewed and modified at any time.\r\n\r\n### 🎭 Character fixed appearance library: appearance never drifts\r\n- **Automatic profile creation for first appearance**: When a named official character appears for the first time, Bai Baohui will automatically record his fixed appearance such as hair color, eye color, body shape, etc., and he will look the same in every picture thereafter.\r\n- **Only report the name, do not copy the appearance**: AI Just write \"@character name\" in the prompt word, and the plug-in will automatically replace it with the latest and most accurate appearance in the file - completely eliminating the drift problem of \"blond hair on one floor, black hair on the next floor\".\r\n- **Automatic update of permanent changes**: The character dyes, cuts, scars, grows up... These permanent changes will be automatically recorded in the file, and **take effect according to the plot position**: the picture before the change uses the old appearance, and the picture after the change uses the new appearance, so the timeline is not messy.\r\n- **Temporary status is not confused**: Temporary status such as wig, wet body, and bandage will not pollute the file, but will continue to remain in the same scene until the plot is resolved.\r\n- **Manual Editing and Rollback**: Files can be manually modified and deleted at any time; every automatic change of AI is recorded and can be rolled back with one click.\r\n- **Global Character Library**: Player characters and other characters that \"use the same face in every chat\" can be \"promoted to global\" with one click on the character management page - after that, all chats will automatically take effect, without the need to repeatedly create files. The global role is a frozen file: AI will never modify it and is completely maintained manually by you. If you want a certain chat to be different, just copy it back to the original chat to overwrite it.\r\n\r\n### 🎨 Picture publishing channel: ComfyUI and NovelAI\r\n- **ComfyUI**: There are two configuration methods to choose from - **Simple Parameters** mode directly selects basic parameters such as model/LoRA, number of steps, etc. to output the picture (built-in Checkpoint series/Flux/Anima template, the model list is pulled from ComfyUI with one click); **Customized workflow** mode loads your own API workflow template, and the placeholders are automatically filled in tag, description and size, don't worry about how to connect the nodes - **AI will automatically locate** which node to fill in, which fragments to keep, and you can preview the changes before applying.\r\n- **Multiple sets of workflows can be switched at any time**: You can save a set of commonly used workflows and give them names, and you can change them by just pulling down. Natural language switches and horizontal and vertical dimensions all follow the workflow - switching back and forth between the 2D base mold and Flux, there is no need to change settings one by one.\r\n- **Fixed horizontal image/vertical image**: Next to the size of each channel, there is \"frame orientation\": automatic/portrait/landscape. After locking, each picture will be produced in this direction. AI will also compose the picture according to this frame when writing prompt words. There is no need to fill in the horizontal and vertical dimensions to make it up (ComfyUI has its own settings for each set of workflows).\r\n- **NovelAI**: Official v3 / v4 / v5 series models; supports vibe reference pictures (character style, painting style reference); `.naiv4vibe` files are interoperable with the official, and can be imported or exported.\r\n- **NAI multiple access points can be switched at any time**: The official site and each third-party site can each save one, name each, and remember their own Key, and just pull down and switch. Changing stations only changes the outlet - the parameters such as model, sampler, size, vibe, and artist string are all the same as before, and there is no need to reconfigure them again. The official one is built-in, so there is no need to fill in the address.\r\n- **NAI natural language can be turned on or off**: NAI 4.5's prompt words have a maximum length (the screen shares about 512 token with all characters). The natural language description takes up the most space. The excess part will be cut off and the screen will be distorted. If you think 4.5 draws strangely, you can turn off \"Generate Natural Language\" in the NAI channel and let AI only write tag.\r\n- **Channel flexibility**: You can assign a dedicated secondary API channel to run the chart without occupying the main conversation; it will follow the main API without configuration.\r\n- **Artist strings can be switched at any time**: You can save a set of commonly used painting styles/artist combinations and give them names. You can change them by dragging them down, or you can choose \"not to use\". The selected artist string will be spelled at the beginning of the prompt word, and the style and tone of the entire painting will be set at once.\r\n- **Intelligent default of negative words and quality words**: Each model has officially recommended quality words and negative words. Click on it to see the actual effective content; change it if you want. After the change is completed, it will be marked \"Customized\", and you can restore the default at any time with one click.\r\n\r\n### 📁 Picture management, chat and save anytime\r\n- **Embedded floor cards**: The generated pictures are directly embedded under the corresponding floors, corresponding to the plot one-to-one.\r\n- **Adjustable display size**: Do you think the pictures on the floor are too big on the wide screen of your computer? The \"floor image display size\" on the settings page has four levels: small/medium/large/full. Only the size displayed in the chat is changed, the image resolution is not affected, and the image file remains unchanged.\r\n- **Click to enlarge, long press to save**: View the large picture in the lightbox, long press the picture to save it locally.\r\n- **Picture information can be traced back**: Each picture is recorded with the complete prompt words, artist string, vibe (including intensity), model and sampling parameters; click on it in the light box or gallery to see how it was drawn at that time - you will never forget which formula was used for your favorite picture.\r\n- **Regenerate and Cancel**: If you are not satisfied with a certain picture, click to redraw it (reproduce a picture with the same prompt word); if you feel that the prompt word is not written properly, open the pencil (edit prompt word) pop-up window, where you can change it yourself, or click \"AI Rewrite Prompt Word\" to have it reread the plot, rewrite the prompt word of this picture and then publish the picture - only touch this one, other pictures in the same building will not be affected. During rewriting, you can safely close the pop-up window, the generation will not be interrupted, and you can continue to watch it when you open it again; if you want to reselect the entire screen, use the color palette button in the Messages ⋯ menu. You can cancel it at any time while it is being generated, so you don’t waste your credit.\r\n- **Smart Queue**: Multiple pictures are queued to generate, and the number of concurrency is adjustable, so the channel will not be crowded.\r\n- **Optional JPG transfer**: When smaller file size is required, PNG can be automatically transferred to JPG.\r\n\r\n### 🤝 Seamless collaboration with BaiBai Book\r\n- Bai Baohui reads the character status and plot memory of BaiBai Book to make the illustrations closely match the \"plot at the moment\".\r\n- Don't want to be disturbed by a certain content? **The exclusion list is shared with BaiBai Book** - Exclude by character, by the entire World Info or by entry name, both ends are synchronized, and one setting takes effect on both sides.\r\n\r\n### ⚙️ You can adjust it as finely as you want.\r\n- **All prompt words are editable**: limit breaking, drawing specifications, thinking chain... Each set has built-in defaults, and can also be customized. In the specification and thinking chain, you can also use `{{#nl}}…{{/nl}}` / `{{^nl}}…{{/nl}}` to write paragraphs that only take effect when \"Generate Natural Language\" is turned on/off. A prompt word can be used in both modes.\r\n- **Multiple Theme Interface**: Automatically follows SillyTavern color matching, suitable for mobile phones, tablets, and computers.\r\n- **Automatic update**: When a new version is available, a small red dot will light up in the navigation bar, and the settings page will be updated with one click and automatically refreshed.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Installation\r\n\r\nJust fill in the warehouse address in SillyTavern's \"Extension → Install Extension\":\r\n\r\n```\r\nhttps://github.com/baibai-git/ST-BaiBai-Image\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter installation, enter the \"Settings\" page: first go to the \"Channel\" page to configure the image publishing channel (local ComfyUI or NovelAI account), and then confirm that the \"Automatically generate tag\" switch is turned on, and then you can start automatic image matching. The settings will be saved on the server with SillyTavern and automatically synchronized across devices.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Tips\r\n\r\n- **Out-of-the-box**: Under the default settings, as long as the picture output channel is configured, AI will automatically add pictures to each chat section; if you do not want to automatically produce pictures and just want to write tag first, just turn off the \"Automatically generate pictures\" switch.\r\n- **The character appearance database is automatically maintained**: You don't need to enter any characters in advance. The plug-in will automatically create a file when you appear for the first time. If you want to fine-tune it, go to the \"Character Management\" page to start. Fixed roles (such as players) can be \"promoted to global status\", and there is no need to re-create a profile when changing chats.\r\n- **ComfyUI user**: If you don’t want to touch the workflow JSON, you can use the “Simple Parameter” mode to select a model to produce a picture; if you have your own workflow, use the AI automatic configuration function to run it once, and then reuse it. If there are multiple sets of commonly used configurations, you can save multiple sets and switch at any time.\r\n- **NovelAI users**: The vibe reference picture is not necessary, but it can make the style/character more stable; `.naiv4vibe` files are interoperable with the official.\r\n- **Picture data follows the chat**: Deleting the chat will delete the corresponding picture data, and your privacy is controllable.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## To the plugin author\r\n\r\nBaiBai Image has opened a set of public interfaces (`globalThis.STBaiBaiImage`), and other plug-ins can:\r\n\r\n- **Read character library**: Get the characters recorded by Bai Baohui and tag that can be directly drawn;\r\n- **Tiao Baibao draws pictures**: backend configuration, concurrency gate, current limit and backoff, and gallery archiving are all reused, **it is up to you to decide where the picture is displayed**——\r\n  You can draw it on the sidebar or in your own pop-up window. The generated picture will not enter any chat history.\r\n\r\nSee **[PUBLIC_API.md](./PUBLIC_API.md)** for details.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAuthor: Bai Bai · Feedback and suggestions are welcome.\r\n",
+  "# 柏宝绘公开接口（API v1）\r\n\r\n本文面向 SillyTavern 插件、脚本和预设作者。柏宝绘把两件事开放给外部调用：\r\n\r\n1. **读角色库** —— 拿到柏宝绘已记录的角色和可直接出图的 tag\r\n2. **调生图** —— 让柏宝绘出一张图，**图显示在哪里由你决定**\r\n\r\n入口只有一个 JavaScript 全局对象：`globalThis.STBaiBaiImage`。\r\n\r\n## 这个接口解决什么\r\n\r\n柏宝绘自己的图是画在**楼层正文**里的（消息下方的卡片）。有些插件不想要这种呈现——想画在侧边栏、画在自己的弹窗里、画完直接当立绘用。这个接口给的就是这个：柏宝绘负责出图（后端配置、并发闸门、限流退避、落盘归档全都复用），你负责显示。\r\n\r\n**生成的图不会进入任何聊天记录。** 它不出现在楼层正文里，不占楼层卡片，也不写 `message.extra`。默认只会存进柏宝绘图库（见 `save`）。\r\n\r\n## 兼容约定\r\n\r\n- `apiVersion` 当前固定为 `1`。它是**公开数据结构**的版本，与插件自身的 `pluginVersion` 分开——后者天天涨，前者不涨。请按 `apiVersion` 判兼容，不要去解析 `pluginVersion` 的语义。\r\n- 结构只增不改不删：新增可选字段是安全的；改字段含义或删字段一律会升 `apiVersion`。\r\n- 所有返回值都是**普通可克隆对象**的深拷贝：不含函数、不含 Vue 响应式代理、不含类实例。你怎么改返回值都不会影响柏宝绘。\r\n- 楼层编号统一使用 SillyTavern 的零基 `mesid`。\r\n- **错误请按 `error.code` 分支判断**，不要匹配 `message` 文案（中文、会随版本改），也不要用 `instanceof`（跨插件 bundle 边界一律失效）。\r\n\r\n## 等待接口就绪\r\n\r\n插件加载顺序不固定，两条路都要写：\r\n\r\n```js\r\nfunction useBaiBaiImage(callback) {\r\n  if (globalThis.STBaiBaiImage) {\r\n    callback(globalThis.STBaiBaiImage);\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n  window.addEventListener(\r\n    'st-baibai-image:ready',\r\n    () => callback(globalThis.STBaiBaiImage),\r\n    { once: true },\r\n  );\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n就绪后可检查能力：\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst api = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage;\r\n\r\nconsole.log(api.apiVersion);     // 1\r\nconsole.log(api.pluginVersion);  // 柏宝绘插件版本\r\nconsole.log(api.capabilities);\r\n// { globalApi: true, characterLibrary: true, generate: true, saveToGallery: true, events: true }\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 读角色库\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst list = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage.getCharacters();\r\n\r\nfor (const character of list.characters) {\r\n  console.log(character.name, character.tag);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n返回结构：\r\n\r\n```js\r\n{\r\n  apiVersion: 1,\r\n  pluginVersion: \"0.2.5\",\r\n  revision: 7,          // 角色库每变一次 +1，拿它做缓存失效\r\n  floor: null,          // 快照对应的楼层；null = 当前\r\n  characters: [\r\n    {\r\n      name: \"阿黛尔\",\r\n      // 可直接拿去出图的完整 tag 串 —— 推荐直接用这个\r\n      tag: \"1girl, short silver hair, blue eyes, pale skin, slender, scar on left eyebrow, black coat\",\r\n      // 分字段版本（要自己挑着用时才需要）\r\n      fields: {\r\n        fandom: \"\",     // 同人身份\r\n        sex: \"1girl\",\r\n        hair: \"short silver hair\",\r\n        eyes: \"blue eyes\",\r\n        skin: \"pale skin\",\r\n        body: \"slender\",\r\n        extra: \"scar on left eyebrow\",  // 标志特征\r\n        outfit: \"black coat\",\r\n      },\r\n      nl: \"a girl with short silver hair\",  // 自然语言外貌（可空）\r\n      source: \"ai\",        // 'manual' 用户手写 | 'ai' AI 在剧情里建的档 | 'book' 从柏宝书同步\r\n      scope: \"chat\",       // 'chat' 本聊天档案 | 'global' 全局角色库（跨聊天）\r\n      desc: \"银色短发\",     // 建档时那句「为什么长这样」（多为空串）\r\n    },\r\n  ],\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`tag` 是按固定顺序（同人身份→性别→头发→眼睛→肤色→体型→标志特征→着装）拼好的，与柏宝绘自己出图用的串**完全一致**。不建议自己从 `fields` 拼——老条目可能只有整串原文，那条回落逻辑在 `tag` 里已经处理过了。\r\n\r\n### 读历史某一楼的角色档案\r\n\r\n角色档案会随剧情演进（AI 在某楼给角色换了发色）。要为**历史某一楼**出图，就得用那一楼当时的档案，否则会把后来的变更也画进去：\r\n\r\n```js\r\n// 第 42 楼**之前**的角色库快照（不含该楼）\r\nconst atFloor = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage.getCharacters({ floor: 42 });\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 出图前先问后端\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst status = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage.getBackendStatus();\r\n\r\nif (!status.configured) {\r\n  toastr.warning(status.reason);   // reason 是人话，可直接展示给用户\r\n  return;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n返回结构：\r\n\r\n```js\r\n{\r\n  apiVersion: 1,\r\n  pluginVersion: \"0.2.5\",\r\n  backend: \"nai\",              // 'nai' | 'comfyui'\r\n  configured: true,\r\n  model: \"nai-diffusion-4-5-full\",  // NAI 是模型名；ComfyUI 是当前工作流预设名\r\n  supportsCharacters: true,    // 当前后端支不支持多角色提示\r\n  reason: \"\",                  // configured=false 时的原因；已就绪为空串\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n> **不含服务地址与 API Key。** 这两样永远不会出现在任何公开返回值里。\r\n\r\n`supportsCharacters` 只看模型，与配没配齐无关——你可以在用户还没填 Key 时就知道该不该准备 `characters`。**ComfyUI 恒为 `false`**。\r\n\r\n## 调生图\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst api = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage;\r\n\r\nconst result = await api.generate({\r\n  prompt: '1girl, silver hair, moonlight, night sky',\r\n  nl: 'a girl standing under the moonlight',\r\n  size: 'portrait',\r\n});\r\n\r\nmyPanel.querySelector('img').src = result.dataUrl;   // 想显示在哪就显示在哪\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 请求参数\r\n\r\n| 字段 | 类型 | 说明 |\r\n| --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `prompt` | `string` | **必填**，正向 danbooru 短 tag。空串抛 `invalid_args` |\r\n| `nl` | `string?` | 自然语言描述 |\r\n| `negative` | `string?` | 本画面动态负面。**只对 ComfyUI 生效**；NAI 的负面取用户渠道配置 |\r\n| `characters` | `PublicCharacterPrompt[]?` | 多角色提示，见下 |\r\n| `size` | `'portrait' \\| 'landscape'?` | 画幅方向，缺省 `'portrait'`。具体像素取用户在渠道页配的尺寸。**用户在渠道里锁定了画幅方向时一律按锁定方向出图**，这里传什么都不算数（0.3.1 起） |\r\n| `seed` | `number?` | 指定种子（正整数）。省略 = 按用户设置决定 |\r\n| `save` | `boolean?` | 落盘进柏宝绘图库，**默认 `true`** |\r\n| `character` | `string?` | 落盘归到哪个角色名下（图库分组名）。省略 = 当前聊天的角色名 |\r\n\r\n### 返回值\r\n\r\n```js\r\n{\r\n  apiVersion: 1,\r\n  pluginVersion: \"0.2.5\",\r\n  dataUrl: \"data:image/png;base64,...\",   // 可直接 <img src>\r\n  format: \"png\",\r\n  path: \"/user/images/柏宝绘_阿黛尔/bbi_....png\",  // 落盘路径；save=false 或落盘失败为 null\r\n  seed: 3847562910,       // 本次实际使用的种子；想复现就把它填回 seed\r\n  backend: \"nai\",\r\n  charactersApplied: true,\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n图是 **data URL** 而不是 blob URL：blob 要配对 `revokeObjectURL`，你忘了就泄漏、我们替你 revoke 又会让你的 `<img>` 突然变空白。代价是字符串比较大，用完别长期留在内存里。\r\n\r\n### 关于 `save`\r\n\r\n- `true`（默认）：图存进 `user/images/柏宝绘_<character>/`，并写一份同名侧写 json 记下提示词和种子。于是用户能在**柏宝绘图库页**里按角色分组看到它、连提示词一起。侧写记的是**实际出图的方向**（用户锁定了画幅时与你传的 `size` 不同）。\r\n- `false`：只返回 `dataUrl`，不碰磁盘。适合「预览一下就丢」。\r\n\r\n落盘**失败不会抛错**——图已经在 `dataUrl` 里了，不能因为存不进图库就让你连图都拿不到。这种情况 `path` 是 `null`。\r\n\r\n### 多角色（NAI 4.5 / V5）\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst status = api.getBackendStatus();\r\nconst library = api.getCharacters().characters;\r\n\r\nconst result = await api.generate({\r\n  prompt: '2girls, cafe, afternoon light',\r\n  characters: status.supportsCharacters\r\n    ? library.slice(0, 2).map(c => ({ name: c.name, tag: c.tag, nl: c.nl }))\r\n    : [],\r\n});\r\n\r\nif (!result.charactersApplied) {\r\n  console.log('当前后端不支持多角色，这次只用了 prompt');\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`charactersApplied` 明说这次到底用上了没有。柏宝绘**刻意不降级**把角色拼进 `prompt`——那会画出多份躯干重叠的图。要画多角色，请先看 `supportsCharacters`。\r\n\r\n### 进度与取消\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst controller = new AbortController();\r\n\r\nconst result = await api.generate(\r\n  { prompt: '1girl' },\r\n  {\r\n    signal: controller.signal,\r\n    onProgress: p => {\r\n      // 'queued' 在柏宝绘的 NAI 并发闸门里排队\r\n      // 'generating' 请求已发出，后端正在画\r\n      // 'queued-remote' 在 ComfyUI 服务端队列里（p.ahead 为前面还有几个）\r\n      // 'retrying' 被限流了，正在退避重试（p.attempt / p.max）\r\n      // 'saving' 图已拿到，正在落盘\r\n      console.log(p.phase, p.ahead, p.attempt, p.max);\r\n    },\r\n  },\r\n);\r\n\r\n// 取消：generate 会抛 code='aborted'\r\ncontroller.abort();\r\n```\r\n\r\n`onProgress` 抛错只会被记进 console，不影响生成。\r\n\r\n### 错误处理\r\n\r\n```js\r\ntry {\r\n  await api.generate({ prompt: '1girl' });\r\n} catch (error) {\r\n  switch (error.code) {\r\n    case 'aborted':        break;                        // 你自己取消的\r\n    case 'not_configured': toastr.warning(error.message); break;  // 用户没配好后端\r\n    case 'invalid_args':   console.error(error.message);  break;  // 你传错了\r\n    case 'rate_limited':   toastr.warning('被限流了，稍后再试'); break;\r\n    case 'backend_error':  toastr.error(error.message);   break;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`rate_limited` 与 `backend_error` 分开，是因为处置方式不同：前者该等一会儿再来（柏宝绘的自动退避重试已经用尽了），后者是配置/网络问题，立刻重来也是同样的错。\r\n\r\n### 不要绕过这个接口\r\n\r\n柏宝绘内部的 NAI 请求全部走一道**并发闸门 + 全局节奏**（429 冷却、相邻请求最小间隔、指数退避重试）。这个接口把闸门包在里面了。如果你绕过它直接打 NAI 的 `generate-image`，用户的账号会吃一串密集 429——而用户只会认为是柏宝绘坏了。\r\n\r\n## 订阅角色库变更\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst unsubscribe = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage.subscribe(notice => {\r\n  console.log(notice.type);      // 'ready' | 'changed'\r\n  console.log(notice.revision);  // 与 getCharacters().revision 同源\r\n  console.log(notice.chatId);\r\n  refreshMyCharacterPicker();\r\n});\r\n\r\n// 不需要时记得退订\r\nunsubscribe();\r\n```\r\n\r\n切聊天、删楼、滑动、用户手动改档案、AI 在剧情里建档——凡是角色库变了都会通知。同一批变更会攒成一条，不会刷屏。\r\n\r\n也可以直接监听 DOM 事件（内容与 `subscribe` 的回调参数相同）：\r\n\r\n```js\r\nwindow.addEventListener('st-baibai-image:ready', e => console.log(e.detail));\r\nwindow.addEventListener('st-baibai-image:changed', e => console.log(e.detail));\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 完整示例\r\n\r\n```js\r\nfunction useBaiBaiImage(callback) {\r\n  if (globalThis.STBaiBaiImage) return callback(globalThis.STBaiBaiImage);\r\n  window.addEventListener('st-baibai-image:ready',\r\n    () => callback(globalThis.STBaiBaiImage), { once: true });\r\n}\r\n\r\nuseBaiBaiImage(async api => {\r\n  if (api.apiVersion !== 1) {\r\n    console.warn('柏宝绘接口版本不匹配', api.apiVersion);\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  const status = api.getBackendStatus();\r\n  if (!status.configured) {\r\n    toastr.warning(`柏宝绘未就绪：${status.reason}`);\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  const heroine = api.getCharacters().characters.find(c => c.name === '阿黛尔');\r\n  if (!heroine) return;\r\n\r\n  try {\r\n    const result = await api.generate({\r\n      prompt: `${heroine.tag}, cafe, afternoon light`,\r\n      nl: heroine.nl,\r\n      size: 'landscape',\r\n      character: heroine.name,   // 落盘归到「柏宝绘_阿黛尔」目录下\r\n    });\r\n    document.querySelector('#my-portrait').src = result.dataUrl;\r\n  } catch (error) {\r\n    if (error.code !== 'aborted') toastr.error(error.message, '出图失败');\r\n  }\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 接口一览\r\n\r\n```ts\r\ninterface STBaiBaiImageApi {\r\n  readonly apiVersion: 1;\r\n  readonly pluginVersion: string;\r\n  readonly capabilities: PublicCapabilities;\r\n  getCharacters(options?: { floor?: number }): PublicCharacterList;\r\n  getBackendStatus(): PublicBackendStatus;\r\n  generate(request: GenerateRequest, options?: GenerateOptions): Promise<GenerateResult>;\r\n  subscribe(listener: (notice: PublicChangeNotice) => void): () => void;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n完整类型定义见插件源码 `src/public/types.ts`。\r\n": "# BaiBai Image public interface (API v1)\r\n\r\nThis article is intended for SillyTavern plug-in, script and preset authors. BaiBai Image opens two things to external calls:\r\n\r\n1. **Read the character library** - Get the characters recorded by Bai Baohui and the tag that can be directly drawn.\r\n2. **Tiaosheng Diagram** - Ask Bobo to draw a picture, **it is up to you to decide where the picture is displayed**\r\n\r\nThere is only one JavaScript global object at the entrance: `globalThis.STBaiBaiImage`.\r\n\r\n## What does this interface solve?\r\n\r\nBai Bao painted his own picture in the **floor text** (the card below the message). Some plug-ins don't want this kind of presentation - they want to draw it on the sidebar, draw it in their own pop-up window, and use it directly as a vertical drawing after drawing. This is what this interface provides: BaiBai Image is responsible for drawing (backend configuration, concurrency gate, current limit backoff, disk placement and archiving are all reused), and you are responsible for displaying.\r\n\r\n**The generated picture will not enter any chat history. ** It does not appear in the floor text, does not occupy the floor card, and does not write `message.extra`. By default, it will only be saved to the Bobo drawing library (see `save`).\r\n\r\n## Compatibility convention\r\n\r\n- `apiVersion` is currently fixed to `1`. It is a version of **public data structure**, separate from the `pluginVersion` of the plugin itself - the latter increases every day, while the former does not. Please press `apiVersion` to determine compatibility, and do not parse the semantics of `pluginVersion`.\r\n- The structure is only added but not modified or deleted: it is safe to add optional fields; changing the meaning of fields or deleting fields will always increase `apiVersion`.\r\n- All return values are deep copies of **normal cloneable objects**: no functions, no Vue reactive proxies, no class instances. No matter how you change the return value, it will not affect BaiBai Image.\r\n- Floor numbers uniformly use the zero base `mesid` of SillyTavern.\r\n- **Please check the `error.code` branch for errors**, do not match the `message` copy (Chinese, will change with the version), and do not use `instanceof` (cross-plugin bundle boundaries will be invalid).\r\n\r\n## Wait for the interface to be ready\r\n\r\nThe plug-in loading order is not fixed, both ways must be written:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nfunction useBaiBaiImage(callback) {\r\n  if (globalThis.STBaiBaiImage) {\r\n    callback(globalThis.STBaiBaiImage);\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n  window.addEventListener(\r\n    'st-baibai-image:ready',\r\n    () => callback(globalThis.STBaiBaiImage),\r\n    { once: true },\r\n  );\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nOnce ready, capabilities can be checked:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst api = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage;\r\n\r\nconsole.log(api.apiVersion);     // 1\r\nconsole.log(api.pluginVersion); // BaiBai Image plug-in version\r\nconsole.log(api.capabilities);\r\n// { globalApi: true, characterLibrary: true, generate: true, saveToGallery: true, events: true }\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Read character library\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst list = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage.getCharacters();\r\n\r\nfor (const character of list.characters) {\r\n  console.log(character.name, character.tag);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nReturn structure:\r\n\r\n```js\r\n{\r\n  apiVersion: 1,\r\n  pluginVersion: \"0.2.5\",\r\n  revision: 7, // Every time the character library changes +1, use it to invalidate the cache\r\n  floor: null, // The floor corresponding to the snapshot; null = current\r\n  characters: [\r\n    {\r\n      name: \"Adele\",\r\n      // The complete tag string that can be used directly for drawing - it is recommended to use this directly\r\n      tag: \"1girl, short silver hair, blue eyes, pale skin, slender, scar on left eyebrow, black coat\",\r\n      //Field-by-field version (required only if you want to choose and use it yourself)\r\n      fields: {\r\n        fandom: \"\", // fan identity\r\n        sex: \"1girl\",\r\n        hair: \"short silver hair\",\r\n        eyes: \"blue eyes\",\r\n        skin: \"pale skin\",\r\n        body: \"slender\",\r\n        extra: \"scar on left eyebrow\", // Logo features\r\n        outfit: \"black coat\",\r\n      },\r\n      nl: \"a girl with short silver hair\", // Natural language appearance (optional)\r\n      source: \"ai\", // 'manual' user handwriting | 'ai' AI file created in the plot | 'book' synchronized from BaiBai Book\r\n      scope: \"chat\", // 'chat' this chat file | 'global' global character library (cross-chat)\r\n      desc: \"Silver short hair\", // The sentence \"Why does it look like this\" when creating the file (mostly empty string)\r\n    },\r\n  ],\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`tag` is put together in a fixed order (identity → gender → hair → eyes → skin color → body shape → iconic features → clothing), which is exactly the same as the string used by Bai Baohui for his own drawings. It is not recommended to spell it from `fields` - the old entry may only have the entire original text, and the fallback logic has been processed in `tag`.\r\n\r\n### Read the character files of a certain historical floor\r\n\r\nThe character profile will evolve with the plot (AI changed the hair color of the character in a certain building). If you want to draw a picture for a certain historical floor, you have to use the archives of that floor at that time, otherwise the subsequent changes will also be drawn:\r\n\r\n```js\r\n//The character library snapshot before the 42 building** (excluding this building)\r\nconst atFloor = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage.getCharacters({ floor: 42 });\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Ask the backend before publishing the picture\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst status = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage.getBackendStatus();\r\n\r\nif (!status.configured) {\r\n  toastr.warning(status.reason); // reason is human language and can be displayed directly to the user\r\n  return;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nReturn structure:\r\n\r\n```js\r\n{\r\n  apiVersion: 1,\r\n  pluginVersion: \"0.2.5\",\r\n  backend: \"nai\",              // 'nai' | 'comfyui'\r\n  configured: true,\r\n  model: \"nai-diffusion-4-5-full\", // NAI is the model name; ComfyUI is the current workflow default name\r\n  supportsCharacters: true, // The current front-end support does not support multi-role prompts\r\n  reason: \"\", // The reason when configured=false; ready is an empty string\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n> **Does not include service address and API Key. ** These two will never appear in any public return value.\r\n\r\n`supportsCharacters` only looks at the model, and has nothing to do with whether it is equipped or not - you can know whether to prepare `characters` before the user fills in Key. **ComfyUI is always `false`**.\r\n\r\n## Tiaosheng Diagram\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst api = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage;\r\n\r\nconst result = await api.generate({\r\n  prompt: '1girl, silver hair, moonlight, night sky',\r\n  nl: 'a girl standing under the moonlight',\r\n  size: 'portrait',\r\n});\r\n\r\nmyPanel.querySelector('img').src = result.dataUrl; // Display it wherever you want.\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Request parameters\r\n\r\n| Field | Type | Description |\r\n| --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `prompt` | `string` | **Required**, forward danbooru short tag. Empty string throw `invalid_args` |\r\n| `nl` | `string?` | Natural language description |\r\n| `negative` | `string?` | This screen is dynamically negative. **Only valid for ComfyUI**; NAI’s negative user channel configuration |\r\n| `characters` | `PublicCharacterPrompt[]?` | Multi-character tips, see below |\r\n| `size` | `'portrait' \\| 'landscape'?` | Frame direction, default `'portrait'`. The specific pixel is the size configured by the user on the channel page. **When the user locks the frame direction in the channel, the picture will be output in the locked direction**, nothing uploaded here will count (from 0.3.1) |\r\n| `seed` | `number?` | Specifies the seed (positive integer). Omitted = determined by user settings |\r\n| `save` | `boolean?` | Place the disk into the Baiba drawing library, **default is `true`** |\r\n| `character` | `string?` | Which character's name the placement belongs to (gallery group name). Omitted = current chat character name |\r\n\r\n### Return value\r\n\r\n```js\r\n{\r\n  apiVersion: 1,\r\n  pluginVersion: \"0.2.5\",\r\n  dataUrl: \"data:image/png;base64,...\", // can directly <img src>\r\n  format: \"png\",\r\n  path: \"/user/images/Babao painted _ Adele/bbi_....png\", // The placement path; save=false or the placement failure is null\r\n  seed: 3847562910, // The actual seed used this time; if you want to reproduce it, fill it back in seed\r\n  backend: \"nai\",\r\n  charactersApplied: true,\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe picture is **data URL** instead of blob URL: blob needs to be paired with `revokeObjectURL`. If you forget it, it will leak. We will replace your revoke and your `<img>` will suddenly become blank. The price is that the string is relatively large and should not remain in memory for a long time after use.\r\n\r\n### About `save`\r\n\r\n- `true` (default): Save the picture into `user/images/柏宝绘_<character>/`, and write a profile of the same name json. Write down the prompt words and seeds. So the user can see it grouped by role on the **Babao Drawing Library Page**, together with the prompt words. The profile records the **actual direction of drawing** (which is different from the `size` you passed when the user locked the frame).\r\n- `false`: only returns `dataUrl`, without touching the disk. Suitable for \"preview and throw away\".\r\n\r\nThere will be no error if the placement **fails** - the picture is already in `dataUrl`. You cannot get the picture just because it cannot be saved in the gallery. In this case `path` is `null`.\r\n\r\n### Multiple roles (NAI 4.5 / V5)\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst status = api.getBackendStatus();\r\nconst library = api.getCharacters().characters;\r\n\r\nconst result = await api.generate({\r\n  prompt: '2girls, cafe, afternoon light',\r\n  characters: status.supportsCharacters\r\n    ? library.slice(0, 2).map(c => ({ name: c.name, tag: c.tag, nl: c.nl }))\r\n    : [],\r\n});\r\n\r\nif (!result.charactersApplied) {\r\n  console.log('The current backend does not support multiple roles, this time only prompt was used');\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`charactersApplied` clearly stated whether it was used this time. Bai Baowei **deliberately not downgraded** the character into `prompt` - that will draw multiple overlapping torsos. To draw multiple characters, please look at `supportsCharacters` first.\r\n\r\n### Progress and Cancellation\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst controller = new AbortController();\r\n\r\nconst result = await api.generate(\r\n  { prompt: '1girl' },\r\n  {\r\n    signal: controller.signal,\r\n    onProgress: p => {\r\n      // 'queued' is queued in BaiBai Image's NAI concurrent gate\r\n      // 'generating' request has been sent and the backend is drawing\r\n      // 'queued-remote' is in the ComfyUI server queue (p.ahead is the first one)\r\n      // 'retrying' has been limited and is backing off and trying again (p.attempt / p.max)\r\n      // 'saving' picture has been obtained and is being placed.\r\n      console.log(p.phase, p.ahead, p.attempt, p.max);\r\n    },\r\n  },\r\n);\r\n\r\n// Cancel: generate will throw code='aborted'\r\ncontroller.abort();\r\n```\r\n\r\n`onProgress` throw error will only be recorded as console and will not affect the generation.\r\n\r\n### Error handling\r\n\r\n```js\r\ntry {\r\n  await api.generate({ prompt: '1girl' });\r\n} catch (error) {\r\n  switch (error.code) {\r\n    case 'aborted': break; // You canceled it yourself\r\n    case 'not_configured': toastr.warning(error.message); break; // The user has not configured the backend properly\r\n    case 'invalid_args': console.error(error.message); break; // You sent the wrong message\r\n    case 'rate_limited': toastr.warning('The current is limited, try again later'); break;\r\n    case 'backend_error':  toastr.error(error.message);   break;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`rate_limited` and `backend_error` are separated because of different handling methods: the former should wait for a while (BaiBai Image's automatic backoff retries have been exhausted), the latter is a configuration/network problem, and it will be the same error if you try again immediately.\r\n\r\n### Do not bypass this interface\r\n\r\nAll NAI requests within BaiBai Image go through the same **concurrency gate + global rhythm** (429 cooling, minimum interval between adjacent requests, exponential backoff retry). This interface wraps the gate inside. If you bypass it and type NAI's `generate-image` directly, the user's account will be flooded with 429 - and the user will only think that Bai Baohui is broken.\r\n\r\n## Subscribe to character library changes\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst unsubscribe = globalThis.STBaiBaiImage.subscribe(notice => {\r\n  console.log(notice.type);      // 'ready' | 'changed'\r\n  console.log(notice.revision); // Same origin as getCharacters().revision\r\n  console.log(notice.chatId);\r\n  refreshMyCharacterPicker();\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Remember to unsubscribe when you don’t need it\r\nunsubscribe();\r\n```\r\n\r\nSwitch chat, delete buildings, swipe, users manually change files, AI creates files in the story - all changes to the character library will be notified. Changes in the same batch will be collected into one line and the screen will not be refreshed.\r\n\r\nYou can also directly listen to the DOM event (the content is the same as the callback parameter of `subscribe`):\r\n\r\n```js\r\nwindow.addEventListener('st-baibai-image:ready', e => console.log(e.detail));\r\nwindow.addEventListener('st-baibai-image:changed', e => console.log(e.detail));\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Complete example\r\n\r\n```js\r\nfunction useBaiBaiImage(callback) {\r\n  if (globalThis.STBaiBaiImage) return callback(globalThis.STBaiBaiImage);\r\n  window.addEventListener('st-baibai-image:ready',\r\n    () => callback(globalThis.STBaiBaiImage), { once: true });\r\n}\r\n\r\nuseBaiBaiImage(async api => {\r\n  if (api.apiVersion !== 1) {\r\n    console.warn('BaiBai Image interface version does not match', api.apiVersion);\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  const status = api.getBackendStatus();\r\n  if (!status.configured) {\r\n    toastr.warning(`柏宝绘未就绪：${status.reason}`);\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  const heroine = api.getCharacters().characters.find(c => c.name === 'Adele');\r\n  if (!heroine) return;\r\n\r\n  try {\r\n    const result = await api.generate({\r\n      prompt: `${heroine.tag}, cafe, afternoon light`,\r\n      nl: heroine.nl,\r\n      size: 'landscape',\r\n      character: heroine.name, //Place it in the directory of \"Babao Painting _ Adele\"\r\n    });\r\n    document.querySelector('#my-portrait').src = result.dataUrl;\r\n  } catch (error) {\r\n    if (error.code !== 'aborted') toastr.error(error.message, 'Picture failed');\r\n  }\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Interface List\r\n\r\n```ts\r\ninterface STBaiBaiImageApi {\r\n  readonly apiVersion: 1;\r\n  readonly pluginVersion: string;\r\n  readonly capabilities: PublicCapabilities;\r\n  getCharacters(options?: { floor?: number }): PublicCharacterList;\r\n  getBackendStatus(): PublicBackendStatus;\r\n  generate(request: GenerateRequest, options?: GenerateOptions): Promise<GenerateResult>;\r\n  subscribe(listener: (notice: PublicChangeNotice) => void): () => void;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nFor the complete type definition, see the plug-in source code `src/public/types.ts`.\r\n"
+}
